{"id":"platte","lemma":"Platte","pos":"noun","rank":3236,"glosses":["flat, thin, regularly (not necessarily circular) shaped object","A flat, fairly large serving plate, or (by extension) the food served on it.","tectonic plate"],"ipa":"/ˈplatə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/04/De-Platte.ogg/De-Platte.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Platte","plural":"Platten"},"examples":[{"text":"Serviere den Fisch auf der Platte dort!","en":"Serve the fish on that platter.","words":[{"g":"to serve","l":"servieren"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"fish"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"there, yonder"}]},{"text":"Sie haben einen Platten.","en":"You have a flat tire.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null]},{"text":"Es klingt, als hättest du einen Sprung in der Platte.","en":"You sound like a broken record.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to ring","l":"klingen"},{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"jump, leap"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Du hast einen Platten.","en":"You have a flat tire.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null]},{"text":"Ich hatte einen Platten.","en":"I had a flat tire.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null]}]}